{"model_version": "gemini-3.7-flash", "content": {"parts": [{"text": "The latest pipeline run (**vertex-demo-e2e-4-20261126**, data as of 2026-11-26) completed successfully and produced 30-day category demand forecasts, 180-day CLV predictions, and customer churn risk scores with feature attributions.\n\n**Model Quality Summary:**\n\n* **Churn (AutoML Tabular):** **Decent lift.** Achieved an **AUC-PR of 0.227** for the reorders class against a baseline positive rate of **6.9%** (AUC-ROC: 0.761). It meaningfully separates churn risks from repeat buyers.\n* **CLV (Custom XGBoost):** **Weak predictive power.** Achieved an **RMSE of 43.11** vs. a baseline RMSE of **43.93**, with an **$R^2$ of 0.037** (3.7%). It barely outperforms predicting the mean, so individual dollar spend estimates carry high uncertainty.\n* **Demand (BigQuery ML ARIMA_PLUS):** **High error and narrow bands.** Across 26 product categories, the holdout **MAPE averaged 39.2%**, and 90% prediction interval **coverage was only 49.6%** (well below the target 90%). The model's uncertainty bands are substantially too narrow for reliable inventory buffer planning.", "thought_signature": "AY89a19Ua0Epv7Xf5D1ynoGYpwveH7B6oczWssZpWKBvM_TvQc4feCFbAzDK9Yo6PEbmPYY30GqgIGKRmKGoaVeSwmqS61kTbhs3RA9LCX2rYpPEoNeKd3sS2cL15ud1-wf-PvRWQqCkihOF8VKQwB7KppXU0iiB73wdNEsJB4Hw8xcg44BR5IBfw37qYbbUyLm09ecROnWOQtTaO5KqovpbSK3ipVKAfmlG4IA169ok48I2vkkMalziPeUyNIsVljXuACFLb_iNH_LKqx3Wp9nccyAHCSAjDr_gCZJgwD-_leRTjqjFuNawZKKufr6nvJC4qDruFS-Le3jQDVPYzJpQO-hQOJqOXZj5k1lRWHrNjoVrsyAGsohJNNzGHYG903VcbLTY5mNTv9DBvUJYgWG8kojVNKGbiOUH8Iyv9rYdk5t3NmFms0-5Dpgu-QVx2g_1kp5V72jXIuUERGcFH41pcGNjyvuiK39y3I9wqlotp6fCcT72FHNLDJbvyIPdtIaEhA2fjs9aZ8ju6b1QyRQu34JKGUSaIg6J8058Uvo2DNQPDL7rqU5t9zdIaDnJ2rAIVqXACiAJgpaV61uhr-DAP9x9lJ6dFz15zU8PlXoMKJPciUK-nxcCWymJQGCDNCHQOG6sTQazgFav1dZyVqdQJFgn1hRQU2pxrwHYlARavQI_2RLp2_grjENMeehXenq_jqPMS_uMPgfc0Be2ZXwg6RxmGOqJs79AMfKcf7WT7pbeeviqvsXCdQW9CFTNlFV8VZ5h1nCs4zjjL1SCYFJNBwgXIP3buo-9Q_YDIpZfjx8-3JvByn0mUBjRFebBGp